  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5cf27982398fffe4696d893c8d8f58e5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Thomas - Relationship
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JusticeIsAWeapon.Data.DialogueNodeSO
  nodeId: Thomas - Relationship
  speakerName: 
  lineText: "You tap the 'Relationship' baseline. \r\n\r\n<b>Detective Miller:</b>
    \r\n\"How were things between you two recently? Being brothers in the same business
    can complicate things.\"\r\n\r\n<b>Thomas Webb:</b> \r\n\"We were family. Obviously,
    we had our disagreements about how the gallery was being run\u2014Marcus was
    obsessive, he refused to liquidate inventory even when it made sense\u2014but
    I supported him. He was a genius. Why are we talking about this instead of finding
    the bastard who killed him?\"\r\n\r\n<b>Investigator's Note:</b> He\u2019s using
    his grief to steer the conversation, but he got incredibly defensive the second
    gallery finances and \"liquidating inventory\" came up. There is tension there,
    but no proof to press him on yet.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r"
